> Documentation for self-managed 3.5.

# Configure the agent

Available: self-managed (GA, 3.5+)

The agent reads `quill.d/`, a folder with a file for each setting. What changed from 3.4: [Upgrade the agent](https://docs.quill.dev/upgrade/).

## Set the API key

Put the key in `quill.d/key`. To make one, see [API keys](https://docs.quill.dev/keys/).
